        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Food having less than 5 miligrams sodium per amount customarily consumed (or for meals and main dishes, less than 5 milligrams sodium per labeled serving). Such food must contain no ingredient that is sodium chloride or generally understood to contain sodium except where the ingredient listed is footnoted &apos;*adds a trivial amount of sodium&apos;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
