        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">In the United States, these claims, usually referred to as &quot;qualified health claims&quot;, are regulated by the Food and Drug Administration in the public interest, see 21 Code of Federal Regulations § 101.14 [http://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cdrh/cfdocs/cfcfr/CFRSearch.cfm?fr=101.14]</obo:IAO_0000115>
