        <obo:IAO_0000116>Generally, &quot;symptoms&quot; are subjective and reported by the patient, while &quot;signs&quot; are observed and reported by a clinician. However, data collected using case report forms are usually relayed by the patient and thus both are deamed &quot;reported by a patient&quot; in this definition.</obo:IAO_0000116>
        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="en">PCDS:signs_and_symptoms</obo:IAO_0000118>
