        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">While &quot;enumeration&quot; is a &quot;data item&quot; not everything referenced within an enumeration qualifies as a &quot;data item&quot;. Not to be confused with &quot;data set&quot; which describes &quot;data item&quot;s of the same type that have something in common.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">data enumeration</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


