        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A categorical investigation datum is a datum pertaining to some entity examined for scientific research or diagnostic purposes and which has a scope that is broader than one of the clinical, environmental or epidemiological domains.</obo:IAO_0000115>
