        <obo:IAO_0000114 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000120"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">ASFIS is a database curated by the United Nations Food And Agriculture Organization (FAO) Fisheries and Aquaculture Statistics and Information Branch (FIPS). It contains over 12,700 species items selected according to their interest or relation to fisheries and aquaculture.</obo:IAO_0000115>
