        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The National Center for Biotechnology Information BioProject standard is a collection of datums that describe biological data related to a single initiative, originating from a single organization or from a consortium.  A BioProject record provides users a single place to find links to the diverse data types generated for that project.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Damion Dooley</obo:IAO_0000117>
