        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>NCBI SRA: COMPLETE_GENOMICS</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Damion Dooley&apos;s note: This platform is in-house and not a product per se. Complete Genomics states: &quot;Complete Genomics’ sequencing platform employs high-density DNA nanoarrays that are populated with DNA nanoballs (DNBs™). Base identification is performed using an unchained ligation-based read technology known as combinatorial probe-anchor ligation (cPAL™). The sequencing instrumentation is custom-developed to support this process. Details are described in our Science publication  (Drmanac et al., 2010).&quot;</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Complete Genomics platform</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


