        <obo:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">Damion Dooley note: OBI has a variety of subclasses like &quot;blood specimen&quot; and &quot;colon specimen&quot; etc. which we have not added here. The are mapped to UBERON terms indirectly through the logic &quot;derives from some [uberon term]&quot;.  GenEpiO takes a different approach in describing this class with  lists for &quot;subject anatomical site&quot;, &quot;subject body product&quot;, and &quot;plant anatomy&quot;.</obo:IAO_0000116>
