        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">PCDS: Provide the email associated with the listed contact. As personnel turnover may render an individual&apos;s email obsolete, it is more prefereable to provide an address for a position or lab, to ensure accuracy of information and institutional memory. If the information is unknown or cannot be provided, leave blank or provide a null value.</rdfs:comment>
