        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym xml:lang="en">endogenous control details slot</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">PCDS: Provide the names of endogenous controls that were used as a reference during extraction. If relevant, include titers of these controls, as well as whether any controls were expected but not identified in the sample.</rdfs:comment>
