        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">PCDS: Residual samples are samples that remain after the sample material was used for its original purpose. Select a residual sample status from the picklist. If sample still exists, select &apos;Residual sample remaining (some sample left)&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">residual sample status</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


