        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">PCDS: This field records the exact date when the antiviral treatment was administered. The date should be provided in a standard format, i.e., ISO 8601 format &apos;YYYY-MM-DD&apos;, and reflect the first administration date if multiple doses were given.</rdfs:comment>
