        <obo:IAO_0000114>requires discussion</obo:IAO_0000114>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A specimen collection device designed for deployment in aquatic environments, typically with a streamlined shape that enables stable positioning in flowing water while facilitating the accumulation of chemical or biological analytes over time.</obo:IAO_0000115>
