        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A DNA sequencer manufactured by Helicos which uses glass flow cells and no amplification step. A sequencing run, generates approximately 1,000,000,000 usable reads with a median read length of about 35 nt.</obo:IAO_0000115>
