        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Abnormality of the hematopoietic system</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Haematological abnormality</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Hematological abnormality</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>The hematopoietic system comprises the organs that are involved in the production of blood, primarily the bone marrow, spleen, tonsils, and lymph nodes.</rdfs:comment>
