        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Increased respiratory rate or depth of breathing</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Polypnea</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>In adults, a beathing rate of between 12-20 breaths per minute is normal and tachypnea is present with a ventilatory rate greater than 20 breaths per minute.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Tachypnea</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


