        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Abnormal skin morphology</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Abnormal skin structure</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Abnormality of skin morphology</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
