        <obo:IAO_0000412 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ido/brucellosis.owl"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Livestock refers to one or more domesticated animals raised in an agricultural setting to produce commodities such as food, fiber and labor. The term &quot;livestock&quot; as used in this article does not include poultry or farmed fish; however the inclusion of these, especially poultry, within the meaning of &quot;livestock&quot; is common. (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Livestock)</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>livestock</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


