        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0020683"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Necrosis of the myocardium, as a result of interruption of the blood supply to the area. It is characterized by a severe and rapid onset of symptoms that may include chest pain, often radiating to the left arm and left side of the neck, dyspnea, sweating, and palpitations.</obo:IAO_0000115>
