        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A DNA sequencer which is manufactured by the Illumina corporation, with a single flow cell and a throughput of up to 35 Gb per day. It supports sequencing of single, long or short insert paired end clone libraries relying on sequencing by synthesis technology.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117>Person: Venkat Malladi, Chris Stoeckert, Jie Zheng</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>HiSeq 1000</obo:IAO_0000118>
