        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A type of historical information or metadata about the origin, location or the source of something, or the history of the ownership or location of an object or resource including digital objects. For example, information about the Principal Investigator who recorded the data, and the information concerning its storage, handling, and migration.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5214-4466</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7702-4495</obo:IAO_0000117>
