        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A count unit of how many Polymerase Chain Reaction (PCR) cycles it took to detect a real signal from a sample. Equivalent to the PCR cycle number at which a sample&apos;s reaction curve intersects the threshold line.</obo:IAO_0000115>
