    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Welcome to the GenEpiO ontology!  The &quot;information content entity&quot; class has many GenEpiO terms.  &quot;data item &gt; measurement data item&quot; has many datum terms; see &quot;data representational model&quot; for collections of terms set up for compatibility with 3rd party sources.

Note that this file contains examples of cities, provinces, states, territories, and soverign nations from around the world; customization of this geographical content would be expected for particular regional use.</rdfs:comment>
    </rdf:Description>
    


